    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*Imagery is of a one bedroom apartment at Alta Verde and is not reflective of a studio apartment, rather the style of our apartments. Please contact us for a viewing to see the specific units available*\r\n\r\nAlta Verde, operated by Domu, is a brand-new apartment development located in the highly sought-after area of Blackrock. Nestled among mature chestnut trees, the three architecturally designed apartment blocks are complemented by best-in-class amenities and offer spectacular views across Dublin Bay, the city skyline, and the Dublin Mountains.\r\n\r\nAlta Verde blends coastal charm with modern convenience. Just minutes from the shoreline and well-connected to the city via DART and bus routes, these thoughtfully designed apartments offer a tranquil retreat with effortless access to everything Dublin has to offer.\r\n\r\nAt Alta Verde, urban living is reimagined. Enjoy premium amenities, stylish interiors, and a community-focused lifestyle. Residents have access to beautifully landscaped outdoor spaces, state-of-the-art fitness facilities, an on-site padel court, dedicated co-working areas, a stunning residents' lounge, rooftop terraces, and exclusive events — all designed to elevate your everyday life.\r\n\r\nDiscover living redefined — apply today and step into a living experience tailored for modern life.\r\n\r\nTo book a viewing visit: www.altaverde.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "*Imagery is of a one bedroom apartment at Alta Verde and is not reflective of a studio apartment, rather the style of our apartments. Please contact us for a viewing to see the specific units available*\r\n\r\n•\tFully furnished apartments with a choice of premium interior finishes\r\n\r\n•\tContemporary fitted kitchens with solid surface countertops and integrated NEFF appliances, including oven, microwave, dishwasher\r\n\r\n•\tBespoke bathrooms and en-suites featuring rainfall showers; select units include baths\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate outdoor balconies for all apartments, with some offering multiple balconies or spacious terraces\r\n\r\n•\tIn-unit washing machine and separate dryer\r\n\r\n•\tIntegrated high-speed internet network for seamless Wi-Fi connectivity\r\n\r\nResidential Amenities: \r\n•\tIreland’s First Build-to-Rent Padel Court – Exclusively for Alta Verde residents\r\n\r\n•\tSecure Underground Parking and/or become a Member of the Car & Van Share Club with premium vehicles options exclusively for Alta Verde residents\r\n\r\n•\tThe Sky Gym & Fitness Suite – Train in a cutting-edge gym with panoramic views\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate Dining Room – Entertain guests with style on Level 8 of the Sylvan Block, complete with stunning views and a wraparound terrace\r\n\r\n•\tRooftop Terraces – Enjoy sweeping views from Dublin Bay to the city skyline, with designated BBQ and a yoga lawn \r\n\r\n•\tCinema & Games Room – A stylish space to relax, socialise, and unwind\r\n\r\n•\tCo-Working Hub – Includes meeting rooms and flexible breakout spaces\r\n\r\n•\tVast Landscaped Gardens – Tranquil green spaces with comfortable outdoor seating\r\n\r\n•\tPet-Friendly Living – Featuring a dedicated pet park and on-site pet wash facilities\r\n\r\n•\tProfessional Onsite Management Team – Ensuring seamless day-to-day living\r\n\r\n•\tSecure Underground Parking – With lift access to all buildings\r\n\r\n•\tSecure Bicycle Storage – Convenient and safe storage for residents’ bikes"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tChoose from a stylish selection of furnished studio, one, two, and three-bedroom apartments in a prime location close to Blackrock village\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate outdoor balconies to all apartments (some apartments enjoy multiple balconies or terrace spaces)\r\n\r\n•\tIreland’s First Build-to-Rent Padel Court – Exclusively for Alta Verde residents\r\n\r\n•\tSecure Underground Parking and/or become a Member of the Car & Van Share Club with premium vehicles options exclusively for Alta Verde residents\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate Dining Room – Entertain guests with style on Level 8 of the Sylvan Block, complete with stunning views and a wraparound terrace\r\n\r\n•\tRooftop Terraces – Enjoy sweeping views from Dublin Bay to the city skyline, with designated BBQ and a yoga lawn\r\n\r\n•\tCinema & Games Room – A stylish space to relax, socialise, and unwind\r\n\r\n•\tCo-Working Hub – Includes meeting rooms and flexible breakout spaces\r\n\r\n•\tVast Landscaped Gardens – Tranquil green spaces with comfortable outdoor seating\r\n\r\n•\tPet-Friendly Living – Featuring a dedicated pet park and on-site pet wash facilities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2/A3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Nestled in the heart of Blackrock, Alta Verde on Cross Avenue offers the perfect blend of coastal charm and urban convenience. \r\n\r\nIdeally situated in South Dublin, it provides seamless access to Dublin City Centre while placing you just minutes from the serenity of the sea and the beauty of the mountains. \r\nWith expansive outdoor spaces, beautifully landscaped surroundings, and a vibrant local community, Alta Verde delivers a lifestyle that harmoniously balances nature and connectivity. Excellent transport links — including direct access to the DART (with just a 12-minute journey to Grand Canal Dock) and major bus routes — ensure everything you need is within easy reach, whether it's a coastal stroll, a mountain hike, or a quick commute into the city.\r\n\r\nDiscover a location that offers the best of both worlds—where modern living meets natural beauty."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "To book a viewing, head to our website: https://www.altaverde.ie/"
      }
    ],
